# "Destroy target creature or planeswalker": on turn 3 Bot2 controls only a Forest, so Bone Shards has no legal target and cannot
# be cast though Bot1 has cards to discard and a Swamp to pay (CR 601.2c). On turn 5, once Bot2 has a Llanowar Elves, the same
# cast is offered - the positive control - and destroys it.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Swamp
Swamp
Bone Shards
Island
Island
Island
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Llanowar Elves
Forest
Forest x10

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
! Bot1.Hand.Bone Shards.Cast
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Llanowar Elves.Cast
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Bone Shards.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves)
Bot1.Modes(Discard a card)
Bot1.Pass
[T5 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Graveyard = Llanowar Elves
